ts it has, the number of AC windows, and the number of doors it has.</p><h3>About Agra</h3><p>Agra is a megacity on the banks of the Yamuna River in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh, about 230 kilometers( 140 mi) southeast of the public capital Delhi and 330 km west of the state capital Lucknow. With a population of roughly 1.6 million, Agra is the fourth-most vibrant megacity in Uttar Pradesh and the twenty-third-most vibrant megacity in India.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,1,'none','Jhansi to Agra Cab/Taxi Hire Oneway Rs.4113','Hire Jhansi To Agra cab online at the best price. Duracabs provides the most affordable and reliable cab service on this route. Price starts at Rs.4113',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(1118,1,'with_driver','car',66,57,'Jhansi,Uttar Pradesh To IGI(T1 Airport) New Delhi,Delhi','jhansi-uttar-pradesh-to-igi-t1-airport-new-delhi-delhi','seo_page','route','one_way',7989.00,8947.00,454.00,7.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<b>Dura Cabs Services</b> is your complete car rental solution, offering local taxi services, outstation trips with a driver, and holiday tour packages across India. Within just a few years, Dura Cabs has established itself as India’s national chauffeur service, with dedicated offices in every major city.\n\nWith a fleet of over 110,000 taxis operating in more than 390 cities, we offer various exciting packages for popular tourist and business destinations. Our user-friendly online portal lets customers check real-time taxi availability and make customized, itinerary-based bookings with ease. We specialize in one-way cab services in Agra, Delhi, Jaipur, Chandigarh, and Shimla.\n\n<h2>What to Expect from Dura Cabs</h2>\n\nAt Dura Cabs, we prioritize customer satisfaction with a friendly and helpful driver team, committed to making your journey enjoyable. Our drivers are well-trained, maintain a strict uniform code